(window.IND_GITA_V = window.IND_GITA_V || {})[11] = [{"v":1,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":"अर्जुन उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"मदनुग्रहाय परमं गुह्यमध्यात्मसंज्ञितम् ।\nयत्त्वयोक्तं वचस्तेन मोहोऽयं विगतो मम ॥","iast":"madanugrahāya paramaṃ guhyamadhyātmasaṃjñitam |\nyattvayoktaṃ vacastena moho’yaṃ vigato mama ||","read":"madanugrahaaya paramam guhyamadhyaatmasamjnitam |\nyattvayoktam vachastena moho'yam vigato mama ||","spli":"arjuna uvāca","splr":"arjuna uvaacha","en":"Arjuna said: This word of the supreme Secret concerning the Self, Thou hast spoken out of compassion; by this my delusion is taken away.","en2":"By the supremely profound words, on the discrimination of Self, that have been spoken by Thee out of compassion towards me, this my delusion is gone.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":2,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"भवाप्ययौ हि भूतानां श्रुतौ विस्तरशो मया ।\nत्वत्तः कमलपत्राक्ष माहात्म्यमपि चाव्ययम् ॥","iast":"bhavāpyayau hi bhūtānāṃ śrutau vistaraśo mayā |\ntvattaḥ kamalapatrākṣa māhātmyamapi cāvyayam ||","read":"bhavaapyayau hi bhootaanaam shrutau vistarasho mayaa |\ntvattah kamalapatraaksha maahaatmyamapi chaavyayam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The production and destruction of beings have been heard by me in detail from Thee, O Lotus-eyed, and also Thy imperishable greatness.","en2":"Of Thee, O lotus-eyed, I have heard at length, of the origin and dissolution of beings, as also Thy inexhaustible greatness.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":3,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"एवमेतद्यथात्थ त्वमात्मानं परमेश्वर ।\nद्रष्टुमिच्छामि ते रूपमैश्वरं पुरुषोत्तम ॥","iast":"evametadyathāttha tvamātmānaṃ parameśvara |\ndraṣṭumicchāmi te rūpamaiśvaraṃ puruṣottama ||","read":"evametadyathaattha tvamaatmaanam parameshvara |\ndrashtumichchhaami te roopamaishvaram purushottama ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"O supreme Lord, even as Thou describest Thyself, O best of beings, I desire to see Thy Form omnipotent.","en2":"So it is, O Lord Supreme! as Thou hast declared Thyself. (Still) I desire to see Thy Ishvara-Form, O Purusha Supreme.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":4,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मन्यसे यदि तच्छक्यं मया द्रष्टुमिति प्रभो ।\nयोगेश्वर ततो मे त्वं दर्शयाऽत्मानमव्ययम् ॥","iast":"manyase yadi tacchakyaṃ mayā draṣṭumiti prabho |\nyogeśvara tato me tvaṃ darśayā’tmānamavyayam ||","read":"manyase yadi tachchhakyam mayaa drashtumiti prabho |\nyogeshvara tato me tvam darshayaa'tmaanamavyayam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"If Thou thinkest that by me It can be seen, O Lord, Lord of Yoga, then show me Thine imperishable Self.","en2":"If, O Lord, Thou thinkest me capable of seeing it, then, O Lord of Yogis, show me Thy immutable Self.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":5,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"पश्य मे पार्थ रूपाणि शतशोऽथ सहस्रशः ।\nनानाविधानि दिव्यानि नानावर्णाकृतीनि च ॥","iast":"paśya me pārtha rūpāṇi śataśo’tha sahasraśaḥ |\nnānāvidhāni divyāni nānāvarṇākṛtīni ca ||","read":"pashya me paartha roopaani shatasho'tha sahasrashah |\nnaanaavidhaani divyaani naanaavarnaakriteeni cha ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: Behold, O Pârtha, a Form of Me, a hundredfold, a thousandfold, various in kind, divine, various in colours and shapes.","en2":"Behold, O son of Prithâ, by hundreds and thousands, My different forms celestial, of various colours and shapes.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":6,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पश्यादित्यान्वसून्रुद्रानश्विनौ मरुतस्तथा ।\nबहून्यदृष्टपूर्वाणि पश्याऽश्चर्याणि भारत ॥","iast":"paśyādityānvasūnrudrānaśvinau marutastathā |\nbahūnyadṛṣṭapūrvāṇi paśyā’ścaryāṇi bhārata ||","read":"pashyaadityaanvasoonrudraanashvinau marutastathaa |\nbahoonyadrishtapoorvaani pashyaa'shcharyaani bhaarata ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Behold the Âdityas, the Vasus, the Rudras, the two Ashvins and also the Maruts; behold many marvels never seen ere this, O Bhârata.","en2":"Behold the Adityas, the Vasus, the Rudras, the twin Ashvins, and the Maruts; behold, O descendant of Bharata, many wonders never seen before.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":7,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"इहैकस्थं जगत्कृत्स्नं पश्याद्य सचराचरम् ।\nमम देहे गुडाकेश यच्चान्यद्द्रष्टुमिच्छसि ॥","iast":"ihaikasthaṃ jagatkṛtsnaṃ paśyādya sacarācaram |\nmama dehe guḍākeśa yaccānyaddraṣṭumicchasi ||","read":"ihaikastham jagatkritsnam pashyaadya sacharaacharam |\nmama dehe gudaakesha yachchaanyaddrashtumichchhasi ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Here, to-day, behold the whole universe, movable and immovable, standing in one in My body, O Gudâkesha, with aught else thou desirest to see.","en2":"See now, O Gudâkesha, in this My body, the whole universe centred in one,—including the moving and the unmoving,—and all else that thou desirest to see.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":8,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"न तु मां शक्यसे द्रष्टुमनेनैव स्वचक्षुषा ।\nदिव्यं ददामि ते चक्षुः पश्य मे योगमैश्वरम् ॥","iast":"na tu māṃ śakyase draṣṭumanenaiva svacakṣuṣā |\ndivyaṃ dadāmi te cakṣuḥ paśya me yogamaiśvaram ||","read":"na tu maam shakyase drashtumanenaiva svachakshushaa |\ndivyam dadaami te chakshuh pashya me yogamaishvaram ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"But verily thou art not able to behold Me with these thine eyes; the divine eye I give unto thee. Behold My sovereign Yoga.","en2":"But thou canst not see Me with these eyes of thine; I give thee supersensuous sight; behold My Yoga Power Supreme.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":9,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":"सञ्जय उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"एवमुक्त्वा ततो राजन्महायोगेश्वरो हरिः ।\nदर्शयामास पार्थाय परमं रूपमैश्वरम् ॥","iast":"evamuktvā tato rājanmahāyogeśvaro hariḥ |\ndarśayāmāsa pārthāya paramaṃ rūpamaiśvaram ||","read":"evamuktvaa tato raajanmahaayogeshvaro harih |\ndarshayaamaasa paarthaaya paramam roopamaishvaram ||","spli":"sañjaya uvāca","splr":"sanjaya uvaacha","en":"Sanjaya said: Having thus spoken, O King, the great Lord of Yoga, Hari, showed to Pârtha His supreme Form as Lord.","en2":"Having thus spoken, O King, Hari, the Great Lord of Yoga, showed unto the son of Prithâ, His Supreme Ishvara-Form—","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":10,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनेकवक्त्रनयनमनेकाद्भुतदर्शनम् ।\nअनेकदिव्याभरणं दिव्यानेकोद्यतायुधम् ॥","iast":"anekavaktranayanamanekādbhutadarśanam |\nanekadivyābharaṇaṃ divyānekodyatāyudham ||","read":"anekavaktranayanamanekaadbhutadarshanam |\nanekadivyaabharanam divyaanekodyataayudham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"With many mouths and eyes, with many visions of marvel, with many divine ornaments, with many upraised divine weapons;","en2":"With numerous mouths and eyes, with numerous wondrous sights, with numerous celestial ornaments, with numerous celestial weapons uplifted;","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":11,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दिव्यमाल्याम्बरधरं दिव्यगन्धानुलेपनम् ।\nसर्वाश्चर्यमयं देवमनन्तं विश्वतोमुखम् ॥","iast":"divyamālyāmbaradharaṃ divyagandhānulepanam |\nsarvāścaryamayaṃ devamanantaṃ viśvatomukham ||","read":"divyamaalyaambaradharam divyagandhaanulepanam |\nsarvaashcharyamayam devamanantam vishvatomukham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Wearing divine necklaces and vestures, anointed with divine unguents, the God all-marvellous, boundless, with face turned everywhere.","en2":"Wearing celestial garlands and apparel, anointed with celestial-scented unguents, the All-wonderful, Resplendent, Boundless and All-formed.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":12,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दिवि सूर्यसहस्रस्य भवेद्युगपदुत्थिता ।\nयदि भाः सदृशी सा स्याद्भासस्तस्य महात्मनः ॥","iast":"divi sūryasahasrasya bhavedyugapadutthitā |\nyadi bhāḥ sadṛśī sā syādbhāsastasya mahātmanaḥ ||","read":"divi sooryasahasrasya bhavedyugapadutthitaa |\nyadi bhaah sadrishee saa syaadbhaasastasya mahaatmanah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"If the splendour of a thousand suns were to blaze out together in the sky, that might resemble the glory of that Mahâtman.","en2":"If the splendour of a thousand suns were to rise up at once in the sky, that would be like the splendour of that Mighty Being.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":13,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तत्रैकस्थं जगत्कृत्स्नं प्रविभक्तमनेकधा ।\nअपश्यद्देवदेवस्य शरीरे पाण्डवस्तदा ॥","iast":"tatraikasthaṃ jagatkṛtsnaṃ pravibhaktamanekadhā |\napaśyaddevadevasya śarīre pāṇḍavastadā ||","read":"tatraikastham jagatkritsnam pravibhaktamanekadhaa |\napashyaddevadevasya shareere paandavastadaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"There Pândava beheld the whole universe, divided into manifold parts, standing in one in the body of the Deity of Deities.","en2":"There in the body of the God of gods, the son of Pându then saw the whole universe resting in one, with its manifold divisions.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":14,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"ततः स विस्मयाविष्टो हृष्टरोमा धनञ्जयः ।\nप्रणम्य शिरसा देवं कृताञ्जलिरभाषत ॥","iast":"tataḥ sa vismayāviṣṭo hṛṣṭaromā dhanañjayaḥ |\npraṇamya śirasā devaṃ kṛtāñjalirabhāṣata ||","read":"tatah sa vismayaavishto hrishtaromaa dhananjayah |\npranamya shirasaa devam kritaanjalirabhaashata ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Then he, Dhananjaya, overwhelmed with astonishment, his hair upstanding, bowed down his head to the Shining One, and with joined palms spake.","en2":"Then Dhananjaya, filled with wonder, with his hair standing on end, bending down his head to the Deva in adoration, spoke with joined palms.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":15,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":"अर्जुन उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"पश्यामि देवांस्तव देव देहे ।\nसर्वांस्तथा भूतविशेषसङ्घान् ।\nब्रह्माणमीशं कमलासनस्थ ।\nमृषींश्च सर्वानुरगांश्च दिव्यान् ॥","iast":"paśyāmi devāṃstava deva dehe |\nsarvāṃstathā bhūtaviśeṣasaṅghān |\nbrahmāṇamīśaṃ kamalāsanastha |\nmṛṣīṃśca sarvānuragāṃśca divyān ||","read":"pashyaami devaamstava deva dehe |\nsarvaamstathaa bhootavisheshasanghaan |\nbrahmaanameesham kamalaasanastha |\nmrisheemshcha sarvaanuragaamshcha divyaan ||","spli":"arjuna uvāca","splr":"arjuna uvaacha","en":"Arjuna said: Within Thy Form, O God, the Gods I see, All grades of beings with distinctive marks; Brahma, the Lord, upon His lotus-throne, The Rishis all, and Serpents, the Divine.","en2":"I see all the Devas, O Deva, in Thy body, and hosts of all grades of beings; Brahma, the Lord, seated on the lotus, and all the Rishis and celestial serpents.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":16,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनेकबाहूदरवक्त्रनेत्रं ।\nपश्यामि त्वां सर्वतोऽनन्तरूपम् ।\nनान्तं न मध्यं न पुनस्तवादिं ।\nपश्यामि विश्वेश्वर विश्वरूप ॥","iast":"anekabāhūdaravaktranetraṃ |\npaśyāmi tvāṃ sarvato’nantarūpam |\nnāntaṃ na madhyaṃ na punastavādiṃ |\npaśyāmi viśveśvara viśvarūpa ||","read":"anekabaahoodaravaktranetram |\npashyaami tvaam sarvato'nantaroopam |\nnaantam na madhyam na punastavaadim |\npashyaami vishveshvara vishvaroopa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"With mouths, eyes, arms, breasts multitudinous, I see Thee everywhere, unbounded Form. Beginning, middle, end, nor source of Thee, Infinite Lord, infinite Form, I find;","en2":"I see Thee of boundless form on every side with manifold arms, stomachs, mouths and eyes; neither the end nor the middle, nor also the beginning of Thee do I see, O Lord of the universe, O Universal Form.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":17,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"किरीटिनं गदिनं चक्रिणं च ।\nतेजोराशिं सर्वतोदीप्तिमन्तम् ।\nपश्यामि त्वां दुर्निरीक्ष्यं समन्ता ।\nद्दीप्तानलार्कद्युतिमप्रमेयम् ॥","iast":"kirīṭinaṃ gadinaṃ cakriṇaṃ ca |\ntejorāśiṃ sarvatodīptimantam |\npaśyāmi tvāṃ durnirīkṣyaṃ samantā |\nddīptānalārkadyutimaprameyam ||","read":"kireetinam gadinam chakrinam cha |\ntejoraashim sarvatodeeptimantam |\npashyaami tvaam durnireekshyam samantaa |\nddeeptaanalaarkadyutimaprameyam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Shining, a mass of splendour everywhere, With discus, mace, tiara, I behold: Blazing as fire, as sun dazzling the gaze, From all sides in the sky, immeasurable.","en2":"I see Thee with diadem, club, and discus; a mass of radiance shining everywhere, very hard to look at, all around blazing like burning fire and sun, and immeasurable.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":18,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"त्वमक्षरं परमं वेदितव्यं ।\nत्वमस्य विश्वस्य परं निधानम् ।\nत्वमव्ययः शाश्वतधर्मगोप्ता ।\nसनातनस्त्वं पुरुषो मतो मे ॥","iast":"tvamakṣaraṃ paramaṃ veditavyaṃ |\ntvamasya viśvasya paraṃ nidhānam |\ntvamavyayaḥ śāśvatadharmagoptā |\nsanātanastvaṃ puruṣo mato me ||","read":"tvamaksharam paramam veditavyam |\ntvamasya vishvasya param nidhaanam |\ntvamavyayah shaashvatadharmagoptaa |\nsanaatanastvam purusho mato me ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Lofty beyond all thought, unperishing, Thou treasure-house supreme, all-immanent; Eternal Dharma's changeless Guardian, Thou; As immemorial Man I think of Thee.","en2":"Thou art the Imperishable, the Supreme Being, the one thing to be known. Thou art the great Refuge of this universe;. Thou art the undying Guardian of the Eternal Dharma, Thou art the Ancient. Purusha, I ween.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":19,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनादिमध्यान्तमनन्तवीर्य ।\nमनन्तबाहुं शशिसूर्यनेत्रम् ।\nपश्यामि त्वां दीप्तहुताशवक्त्रं ।\nस्वतेजसा विश्वमिदं तपन्तम् ॥","iast":"anādimadhyāntamanantavīrya |\nmanantabāhuṃ śaśisūryanetram |\npaśyāmi tvāṃ dīptahutāśavaktraṃ |\nsvatejasā viśvamidaṃ tapantam ||","read":"anaadimadhyaantamanantaveerya |\nmanantabaahum shashisooryanetram |\npashyaami tvaam deeptahutaashavaktram |\nsvatejasaa vishvamidam tapantam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Nor source, nor midst, nor end; infinite force, Unnumbered arms, the sun and moon Thine eyes I see Thy face, as sacrificial fire Blazing, its splendour burneth up the worlds.","en2":"I see Thee without beginning, middle or end, infinite in power, of manifold arms; the sun and the moon Thine eyes, the burning fire Thy mouth; heating the whole universe with Thy radiance.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":20,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"द्यावापृथिव्योरिदमन्तरं हि ।\nव्याप्तं त्वयैकेन दिशश्च सर्वाः ।\nदृष्ट्वाऽद्भुतं रूपमुग्रं तवेदं ।\nलोकत्रयं प्रव्यथितं महात्मन् ॥","iast":"dyāvāpṛthivyoridamantaraṃ hi |\nvyāptaṃ tvayaikena diśaśca sarvāḥ |\ndṛṣṭvā’dbhutaṃ rūpamugraṃ tavedaṃ |\nlokatrayaṃ pravyathitaṃ mahātman ||","read":"dyaavaaprithivyoridamantaram hi |\nvyaaptam tvayaikena dishashcha sarvaah |\ndrishtvaa'dbhutam roopamugram tavedam |\nlokatrayam pravyathitam mahaatman ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"By Thee alone are filled the earth, the heavens, And all the regions that are stretched between; The triple worlds sink down, O mighty One, Before Thine awful manifested Form.","en2":"The space betwixt heaven and earth and all the quarters are filled by Thee alone; having seen this, Thy marvellous and awful Form, the three worlds are trembling with fear, O Great-souled One.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":21,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अमी हि त्वां सुरसङ्घा विशन्ति ।\nकेचिद्भीताः प्राञ्जलयो गृणन्ति ।\nस्वस्तीत्युक्त्वा महर्षिसिद्धसङ्घाः ।\nस्तुवन्ति त्वां स्तुतिभिः पुष्कलाभिः ॥","iast":"amī hi tvāṃ surasaṅghā viśanti |\nkecidbhītāḥ prāñjalayo gṛṇanti |\nsvastītyuktvā maharṣisiddhasaṅghāḥ |\nstuvanti tvāṃ stutibhiḥ puṣkalābhiḥ ||","read":"amee hi tvaam surasanghaa vishanti |\nkechidbheetaah praanjalayo grinanti |\nsvasteetyuktvaa maharshisiddhasanghaah |\nstuvanti tvaam stutibhih pushkalaabhih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"To Thee the troops of Suras enter in, Some with joined palms in awe invoking Thee; Banded Maharshis, Siddhas, cry: \"All hail\"! Chanting Thy praises with resounding songs.","en2":"Verily, into Thee enter these hosts of Devas; some extol Thee in fear with joined palms; \"May it be well!\" thus saying, bands of great Rishis and Siddhas praise Thee with splendid hymns.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":22,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"रुद्रादित्या वसवो ये च साध्या ।\nविश्वेऽश्विनौ मरुतश्चोष्मपाश्च ।\nगन्धर्वयक्षासुरसिद्धसङ्घा ।\nवीक्षन्ते त्वां विस्मिताश्चैव सर्वे ॥","iast":"rudrādityā vasavo ye ca sādhyā |\nviśve’śvinau marutaścoṣmapāśca |\ngandharvayakṣāsurasiddhasaṅghā |\nvīkṣante tvāṃ vismitāścaiva sarve ||","read":"rudraadityaa vasavo ye cha saadhyaa |\nvishve'shvinau marutashchoshmapaashcha |\ngandharvayakshaasurasiddhasanghaa |\nveekshante tvaam vismitaashchaiva sarve ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Rudras, Vasus, Sâdhyas and Adityas, Vishvas, the Ashvins, Maruts, Ushmapas, Gandharvas, Yakshas, Siddhas, Asuras, In wondering multitudes beholding Thee.","en2":"The Rudras, Adityas, Vasus, Sâdhyas, Vishva-Devas, the two Ashvins, Maruts, Ushmapâs, and hosts of Gandharvas, Yakshas, Asuras, and Siddhas,—all these are looking at Thee, all quite astounded.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":23,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"रूपं महत्ते बहुवक्त्रनेत्रं ।\nमहाबाहो बहुबाहूरुपादम् ।\nबहूदरं बहुदंष्ट्राकरालं ।\nदृष्ट्वा लोकाः प्रव्यथितास्तथाऽहम् ॥","iast":"rūpaṃ mahatte bahuvaktranetraṃ |\nmahābāho bahubāhūrupādam |\nbahūdaraṃ bahudaṃṣṭrākarālaṃ |\ndṛṣṭvā lokāḥ pravyathitāstathā’ham ||","read":"roopam mahatte bahuvaktranetram |\nmahaabaaho bahubaahoorupaadam |\nbahoodaram bahudamshtraakaraalam |\ndrishtvaa lokaah pravyathitaastathaa'ham ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Thy mighty Form, with many mouths and eyes, Long armed, with thighs and feet innumerate, Vast-bosomed, set with many fearful teeth, The worlds see terror-struck, as also I.","en2":"Having seen Thy immeasurable Form—with many mouths and eyes, O mighty-armed, with many arms, thighs and feet, with many stomachs, and fearful with many tusks,—the worlds are terrified, and so am I.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":24,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"नभःस्पृशं दीप्तमनेकवर्णं ।\nव्यात्ताननं दीप्तविशालनेत्रम् ।\nदृष्ट्वा हि त्वां प्रव्यथितान्तरात्मा ।\nधृतिं न विन्दामि शमं च विष्णो ॥","iast":"nabhaḥspṛśaṃ dīptamanekavarṇaṃ |\nvyāttānanaṃ dīptaviśālanetram |\ndṛṣṭvā hi tvāṃ pravyathitāntarātmā |\ndhṛtiṃ na vindāmi śamaṃ ca viṣṇo ||","read":"nabhahsprisham deeptamanekavarnam |\nvyaattaananam deeptavishaalanetram |\ndrishtvaa hi tvaam pravyathitaantaraatmaa |\ndhritim na vindaami shamam cha vishno ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Radiant, Thou touchest heaven, rainbow-hued, With opened mouths and shining vast-orbed eyes. My inmost self is quaking, having seen, My strength is withered, Vishnu, and my peace.","en2":"On seeing Thee touching the sky, shining in many a colour, with mouths wide open, with large fiery eyes, I am terrified at heart, and find no courage nor peace, O Vishnu.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":25,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दंष्ट्राकरालानि च ते मुखानि ।\nदृष्ट्वैव कालानलसन्निभानि ।\nदिशो न जाने न लभे च शर्म ।\nप्रसीद देवेश जगन्निवास ॥","iast":"daṃṣṭrākarālāni ca te mukhāni |\ndṛṣṭvaiva kālānalasannibhāni |\ndiśo na jāne na labhe ca śarma |\nprasīda deveśa jagannivāsa ||","read":"damshtraakaraalaani cha te mukhaani |\ndrishtvaiva kaalaanalasannibhaani |\ndisho na jaane na labhe cha sharma |\npraseeda devesha jagannivaasa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Like Time's destroying flames I see Thy teeth, Upstanding, spread within expanded jaws; Nought know I anywhere, no shelter find; Mercy, O God! re of all the worlds!","en2":"Having seen Thy mouths, fearful with tusks, (blazing) like Pralaya-fires, I know not the four quarters, nor do I find peace; have mercy, O Lord of the Devas, O Abode of the universe.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":26,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अमी च त्वां धृतराष्ट्रस्य पुत्राः ।\nसर्वे सहैवावनिपालसङ्घैः ।\nभीष्मो द्रोणः सूतपुत्रस्तथाऽसौ ।\nसहास्मदीयैरपि योधमुख्यैः ॥","iast":"amī ca tvāṃ dhṛtarāṣṭrasya putrāḥ |\nsarve sahaivāvanipālasaṅghaiḥ |\nbhīṣmo droṇaḥ sūtaputrastathā’sau |\nsahāsmadīyairapi yodhamukhyaiḥ ||","read":"amee cha tvaam dhritaraashtrasya putraah |\nsarve sahaivaavanipaalasanghaih |\nbheeshmo dronah sootaputrastathaa'sau |\nsahaasmadeeyairapi yodhamukhyaih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The sons of Dhṛitarâshtra, and with them The multitude of all these kings of earth, Bhîshma, and Drona, Sûta's royal son, And all the noblest warriors of our hosts,","en2":"All these sons of Dhritarâshtra, with hosts of monarchs, Bhishma, Drona, and Sutaputra, with the warrior chiefs of ours, enter precipitately into Thy mouth, terrible with tusks and fearful to behold. Some are found sticking in the interstices of Thy teeth, with their heads crushed to powder.","en2r":"11.26-27","rv":null},{"v":27,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"वक्त्राणि ते त्वरमाणा विशन्ति ।\nदंष्ट्राकरालानि भयानकानि ।\nकेचिद्विलग्ना दशनान्तरेषु ।\nसंदृश्यन्ते चूर्णितैरुत्तमाङ्गैः ॥","iast":"vaktrāṇi te tvaramāṇā viśanti |\ndaṃṣṭrākarālāni bhayānakāni |\nkecidvilagnā daśanāntareṣu |\nsaṃdṛśyante cūrṇitairuttamāṅgaiḥ ||","read":"vaktraani te tvaramaanaa vishanti |\ndamshtraakaraalaani bhayaanakaani |\nkechidvilagnaa dashanaantareshu |\nsamdrishyante choornitairuttamaangaih ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Into Thy gaping mouths they hurrying rush, Tremendous-toothed and terrible to see; Some caught within the gaps between Thy teeth Are seen, their heads to powder crushed and ground.","en2":"All these sons of Dhritarâshtra, with hosts of monarchs, Bhishma, Drona, and Sutaputra, with the warrior chiefs of ours, enter precipitately into Thy mouth, terrible with tusks and fearful to behold. Some are found sticking in the interstices of Thy teeth, with their heads crushed to powder.","en2r":"11.26-27","rv":null},{"v":28,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यथा नदीनां बहवोऽम्बुवेगाः ।\nसमुद्रमेवाभिमुखा द्रवन्ति ।\nतथा तवामी नरलोकवीरा ।\nविशन्ति वक्त्राण्यभिविज्वलन्ति ॥","iast":"yathā nadīnāṃ bahavo’mbuvegāḥ |\nsamudramevābhimukhā dravanti |\ntathā tavāmī naralokavīrā |\nviśanti vaktrāṇyabhivijvalanti ||","read":"yathaa nadeenaam bahavo'mbuvegaah |\nsamudramevaabhimukhaa dravanti |\ntathaa tavaamee naralokaveeraa |\nvishanti vaktraanyabhivijvalanti ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"As river-floods impetuously rush, Hurling their waters into ocean's lap, So fling themselves into Thy flaming mouths, In haste, these mighty men, these lords of earth.","en2":"Verily, as the many torrents of rivers flow towards the ocean, so do these heroes in the world of men enter Thy fiercely flaming mouths.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":29,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यथा प्रदीप्तं ज्वलनं पतङ्गा ।\nविशन्ति नाशाय समृद्धवेगाः ।\nतथैव नाशाय विशन्ति लोका ।\nस्तवापि वक्त्राणि समृद्धवेगाः ॥","iast":"yathā pradīptaṃ jvalanaṃ pataṅgā |\nviśanti nāśāya samṛddhavegāḥ |\ntathaiva nāśāya viśanti lokā |\nstavāpi vaktrāṇi samṛddhavegāḥ ||","read":"yathaa pradeeptam jvalanam patangaa |\nvishanti naashaaya samriddhavegaah |\ntathaiva naashaaya vishanti lokaa |\nstavaapi vaktraani samriddhavegaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"As moths with quickened speed will headlong fly Into a flaming light, to fall destroyed, So also these, in haste precipitate, Enter within Thy mouths destroyed to fall.","en2":"As moths precipitately rush into a blazing fire only to perish, even so do these creatures also precipitately rush into Thy mouths only to perish.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":30,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"लेलिह्यसे ग्रसमानः समन्ता ।\nल्लोकान्समग्रान्वदनैर्ज्वलद्भिः ।\nतेजोभिरापूर्य जगत्समग्रं ।\nभासस्तवोग्राः प्रतपन्ति विष्णो ॥","iast":"lelihyase grasamānaḥ samantā |\nllokānsamagrānvadanairjvaladbhiḥ |\ntejobhirāpūrya jagatsamagraṃ |\nbhāsastavogrāḥ pratapanti viṣṇo ||","read":"lelihyase grasamaanah samantaa |\nllokaansamagraanvadanairjvaladbhih |\ntejobhiraapoorya jagatsamagram |\nbhaasastavograah pratapanti vishno ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"On every side, all-swallowing, fiery-tongued, Thou lickest up mankind, devouring all; The glory filleth space: the universe Is burning, Vishnu, with Thy blazing rays.","en2":"Swallowing all the worlds on every side with Thy flaming mouths, Thou are licking Thy lips. Thy fierce rays, filling the whole world with radiance, are burning, O Vishnu!","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":31,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आख्याहि मे को भवानुग्ररूपो ।\nनमोऽस्तु ते देववर प्रसीद ।\nविज्ञातुमिच्छामि भवन्तमाद्यं ।\nन हि प्रजानामि तव प्रवृत्तिम् ॥","iast":"ākhyāhi me ko bhavānugrarūpo |\nnamo’stu te devavara prasīda |\nvijñātumicchāmi bhavantamādyaṃ |\nna hi prajānāmi tava pravṛttim ||","read":"aakhyaahi me ko bhavaanugraroopo |\nnamo'stu te devavara praseeda |\nvijnaatumichchhaami bhavantamaadyam |\nna hi prajaanaami tava pravrittim ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Reveal Thy Self; what awful Form art Thou? I worship Thee! Have mercy, God supreme! Thine inner Being I am fain to know; This Thy forth-streaming Life bewilders me.","en2":"Tell me who Thou art, fierce in form. Salutation to Thee, O Deva Supreme; have mercy. I desire to know Thee, O Primeval One. I know not indeed Thy purpose.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":32,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"कालोऽस्मि लोकक्षयकृत्प्रवृद्धो ।\nलोकान्समाहर्तुमिह प्रवृत्तः ।\nऋतेऽपि त्वां न भविष्यन्ति सर्वे ।\nयेऽवस्थिताः प्रत्यनीकेषु योधाः ॥","iast":"kālo’smi lokakṣayakṛtpravṛddho |\nlokānsamāhartumiha pravṛttaḥ |\nṛte’pi tvāṃ na bhaviṣyanti sarve |\nye’vasthitāḥ pratyanīkeṣu yodhāḥ ||","read":"kaalo'smi lokakshayakritpravriddho |\nlokaansamaahartumiha pravrittah |\nrite'pi tvaam na bhavishyanti sarve |\nye'vasthitaah pratyaneekeshu yodhaah ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"Time am I, laying desolate the world, Made manifest on earth to slay mankind! Not one of all these warriors ranged for strife Escapeth death; thou shalt alone survive.","en2":"I am the mighty world-destroying Time, here made manifest for the purpose of infolding the world. Even without thee, none of the warriors arrayed in the hostile armies shall live.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":33,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तस्मात्त्वमुत्तिष्ठ यशो लभस्व ।\nजित्वा शत्रून् भुङ्क्ष्व राज्यं समृद्धम् ।\nमयैवैते निहताः पूर्वमेव ।\nनिमित्तमात्रं भव सव्यसाचिन् ॥","iast":"tasmāttvamuttiṣṭha yaśo labhasva |\njitvā śatrūn bhuṅkṣva rājyaṃ samṛddham |\nmayaivaite nihatāḥ pūrvameva |\nnimittamātraṃ bhava savyasācin ||","read":"tasmaattvamuttishtha yasho labhasva |\njitvaa shatroon bhunkshva raajyam samriddham |\nmayaivaite nihataah poorvameva |\nnimittamaatram bhava savyasaachin ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Therefore stand up! win for thyself renown, Conquer thy foes, enjoy the wealth filled realm, By Me they are already overcome, Be thou the outward cause, left-handed one.","en2":"Therefore do thou arise and acquire fame. Conquer the enemies, and enjoy the unrivalled dominion. Verily by Myself have they been already slain; be thou merely an apparent cause, O Savyasâchin (Arjuna).","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":34,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"द्रोणं च भीष्मं च जयद्रथं च ।\nकर्णं तथाऽन्यानपि योधवीरान् ।\nमया हतांस्त्वं जहि मा व्यथिष्ठा ।\nयुध्यस्व जेतासि रणे सपत्नान् ॥","iast":"droṇaṃ ca bhīṣmaṃ ca jayadrathaṃ ca |\nkarṇaṃ tathā’nyānapi yodhavīrān |\nmayā hatāṃstvaṃ jahi mā vyathiṣṭhā |\nyudhyasva jetāsi raṇe sapatnān ||","read":"dronam cha bheeshmam cha jayadratham cha |\nkarnam tathaa'nyaanapi yodhaveeraan |\nmayaa hataamstvam jahi maa vyathishthaa |\nyudhyasva jetaasi rane sapatnaan ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Drona and Bhîshma and Jayadratha, Karna, and all the other warriors here, Are slain by Me. Destroy them fearlessly. Fight! thou shalt crush thy rivals in the field.","en2":"Drona, Bhishma, Jayadratha, Karna, as well as other brave warriors,— these already killed by Me, do thou kill. Be not distressed with fear; fight, and thou shalt conquer thy enemies in battle.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":35,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":"सञ्जय उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"एतच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं केशवस्य ।\nकृताञ्जलिर्वेपमानः किरीटी ।\nनमस्कृत्वा भूय एवाह कृष्णं ।\nसगद्गदं भीतभीतः प्रणम्य ॥","iast":"etacchrutvā vacanaṃ keśavasya |\nkṛtāñjalirvepamānaḥ kirīṭī |\nnamaskṛtvā bhūya evāha kṛṣṇaṃ |\nsagadgadaṃ bhītabhītaḥ praṇamya ||","read":"etachchhrutvaa vachanam keshavasya |\nkritaanjalirvepamaanah kireetee |\nnamaskritvaa bhooya evaaha krishnam |\nsagadgadam bheetabheetah pranamya ||","spli":"sañjaya uvāca","splr":"sanjaya uvaacha","en":"Sanjaya said: Having heard these words of Keshava, he who weareth a diadem, with joined palms, quaking and prostrating himself, spake again to Krishna, stammering with fear, casting down his face.","en2":"Having, heard that speech of Keshava, the diademed one (Arjuna), with joined palms, trembling, prostrated himself, and again addressed Krishna in a choked voice, bowing down, overwhelmed with fear.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":36,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":"अर्जुन उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"स्थाने हृषीकेश तव प्रकीर्त्या ।\nजगत् प्रहृष्यत्यनुरज्यते च ।\nरक्षांसि भीतानि दिशो द्रवन्ति ।\nसर्वे नमस्यन्ति च सिद्धसङ्घाः ॥","iast":"sthāne hṛṣīkeśa tava prakīrtyā |\njagat prahṛṣyatyanurajyate ca |\nrakṣāṃsi bhītāni diśo dravanti |\nsarve namasyanti ca siddhasaṅghāḥ ||","read":"sthaane hrisheekesha tava prakeertyaa |\njagat prahrishyatyanurajyate cha |\nrakshaamsi bheetaani disho dravanti |\nsarve namasyanti cha siddhasanghaah ||","spli":"arjuna uvāca","splr":"arjuna uvaacha","en":"Arjuna said: Hrishîkesha! in Thy magnificence Rightly the world rejoiceth, hymning Thee; The Râkshasas to every quarter fly In fear; the hosts of Siddhas prostrate fall.","en2":"It is meet, O Hrishikesha, that the world is delighted and rejoices in Thy praise, that Râkshasas fly in fear to all quarters and all the hosts of Siddhas bow down to Thee in adoration.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":37,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"कस्माच्च ते न नमेरन्महात्मन् ।\nगरीयसे ब्रह्मणोऽप्यादिकर्त्रे ।\nअनन्त देवेश जगन्निवास ।\nत्वमक्षरं सदसत्तत्परं यत् ॥","iast":"kasmācca te na nameranmahātman |\ngarīyase brahmaṇo’pyādikartre |\nananta deveśa jagannivāsa |\ntvamakṣaraṃ sadasattatparaṃ yat ||","read":"kasmaachcha te na nameranmahaatman |\ngareeyase brahmano'pyaadikartre |\nananta devesha jagannivaasa |\ntvamaksharam sadasattatparam yat ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"How should they otherwise, O loftiest Self! First Cause! Brahmâ Himself less great than Thou. Infinite, God of Gods, home of all worlds, Unperishing, Sat, Asat, That supreme!","en2":"And why should they not, O Great-souled One, bow to Thee, greater than, and the Primal Cause of even Brahmâ, O Infinite Being, O Lord of the Devas, O Abode of the universe? Thou art the Imperishable, the Being and the non-Being, (as well as) That which is Beyond (them).","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":38,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"त्वमादिदेवः पुरुषः पुराण ।\nस्त्वमस्य विश्वस्य परं निधानम् ।\nवेत्तासि वेद्यं च परं च धाम ।\nत्वया ततं विश्वमनन्तरूप ॥","iast":"tvamādidevaḥ puruṣaḥ purāṇa |\nstvamasya viśvasya paraṃ nidhānam |\nvettāsi vedyaṃ ca paraṃ ca dhāma |\ntvayā tataṃ viśvamanantarūpa ||","read":"tvamaadidevah purushah puraana |\nstvamasya vishvasya param nidhaanam |\nvettaasi vedyam cha param cha dhaama |\ntvayaa tatam vishvamanantaroopa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"First of the Gods, most ancient Man Thou art. Supreme receptacle of all that lives; Knower and known, the dwelling-place on high; In Thy vast Form the universe is spread.","en2":"Thou art the Primal Deva, the Ancient Purusha; Thou art the Supreme Refuge of this universe, Thou art the Knower, and the One Thing to be known; Thou art the Supreme Goal. By Thee is the universe pervaded, O Boundless Form.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":39,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"वायुर्यमोऽग्निर्वरुणः शशाङ्कः ।\nप्रजापतिस्त्वं प्रपितामहश्च ।\nनमो नमस्तेऽस्तु सहस्रकृत्वः ।\nपुनश्च भूयोऽपि नमो नमस्ते ॥","iast":"vāyuryamo’gnirvaruṇaḥ śaśāṅkaḥ |\nprajāpatistvaṃ prapitāmahaśca |\nnamo namaste’stu sahasrakṛtvaḥ |\npunaśca bhūyo’pi namo namaste ||","read":"vaayuryamo'gnirvarunah shashaankah |\nprajaapatistvam prapitaamahashcha |\nnamo namaste'stu sahasrakritvah |\npunashcha bhooyo'pi namo namaste ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Thou art Vâyu and Yama, Agni, moon, Varuna, Father, Grandsire of all; Hail, hail to Thee! a thousand times all hail! Hail unto Thee! again, again all hail!","en2":"Thou art Vâyu, Yama, Agni, Varuna, the Moon, Prajâpati, and the Great-Grandfather. Salutation, salutation to Thee, a thousand times, and again and again salutation, salutation to Thee!","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":40,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"नमः पुरस्तादथ पृष्ठतस्ते ।\nनमोऽस्तु ते सर्वत एव सर्व ।\nअनन्तवीर्यामितविक्रमस्त्वं ।\nसर्वं समाप्नोषि ततोऽसि सर्वः ॥","iast":"namaḥ purastādatha pṛṣṭhataste |\nnamo’stu te sarvata eva sarva |\nanantavīryāmitavikramastvaṃ |\nsarvaṃ samāpnoṣi tato’si sarvaḥ ||","read":"namah purastaadatha prishthataste |\nnamo'stu te sarvata eva sarva |\nanantaveeryaamitavikramastvam |\nsarvam samaapnoshi tato'si sarvah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Prostrate in front of Thee, prostrate behind; Prostrate on every side to Thee, O All. In power boundless, measureless in strength, Thou holdest all: then Thou Thyself art All.","en2":"Salutation to Thee before and behind, salutation to Thee on every side, O All! Thou, infinite in power and infinite in prowess, pervadest all; wherefore Thou art All.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":41,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"सखेति मत्वा प्रसभं यदुक्तं ।\nहे कृष्ण हे यादव हे सखेति ।\nअजानता महिमानं तवेदं ।\nमया प्रमादात्प्रणयेन वापि ॥","iast":"sakheti matvā prasabhaṃ yaduktaṃ |\nhe kṛṣṇa he yādava he sakheti |\najānatā mahimānaṃ tavedaṃ |\nmayā pramādātpraṇayena vāpi ||","read":"sakheti matvaa prasabham yaduktam |\nhe krishna he yaadava he sakheti |\najaanataa mahimaanam tavedam |\nmayaa pramaadaatpranayena vaapi ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"If, thinking Thee but friend, importunate, O Krishna! or O Yâdava! O friend! I cried, unknowing of Thy majesty, And careless in the fondness of my love;","en2":"Whatever I have presumptuously said from carelessness or love, addressing Thee as, \"O Krishna, O Yâdava, O friend,\" regarding Thee merely as a friend, unconscious of this Thy greatness—in whatever way I may have been disrespectful to Thee in fun, while walking, reposing, sitting, or at meals, when alone (with Thee), O Achyuta, or in company— [paragraph continues] I implore Thee, Immeasurable One, to forgive all this.","en2r":"11.41-42","rv":null},{"v":42,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यच्चावहासार्थमसत्कृतोऽसि ।\nविहारशय्यासनभोजनेषु ।\nएकोऽथवाप्यच्युत तत्समक्षं ।\nतत्क्षामये त्वामहमप्रमेयम् ॥","iast":"yaccāvahāsārthamasatkṛto’si |\nvihāraśayyāsanabhojaneṣu |\neko’thavāpyacyuta tatsamakṣaṃ |\ntatkṣāmaye tvāmahamaprameyam ||","read":"yachchaavahaasaarthamasatkrito'si |\nvihaarashayyaasanabhojaneshu |\neko'thavaapyachyuta tatsamaksham |\ntatkshaamaye tvaamahamaprameyam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"If jesting I irreverence showed to Thee, At play, reposing, sitting or at meals, Alone, O sinless One, or with my friends, Forgive my error, O Thou boundless One.","en2":"Whatever I have presumptuously said from carelessness or love, addressing Thee as, \"O Krishna, O Yâdava, O friend,\" regarding Thee merely as a friend, unconscious of this Thy greatness—in whatever way I may have been disrespectful to Thee in fun, while walking, reposing, sitting, or at meals, when alone (with Thee), O Achyuta, or in company— [paragraph continues] I implore Thee, Immeasurable One, to forgive all this.","en2r":"11.41-42","rv":null},{"v":43,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"पितासि लोकस्य चराचरस्य ।\nत्वमस्य पूज्यश्च गुरुर्गरीयान् ।\nन त्वत्समोऽस्त्यभ्यधिकः कुतोऽन्यो ।\nलोकत्रयेऽप्यप्रतिमप्रभाव ॥","iast":"pitāsi lokasya carācarasya |\ntvamasya pūjyaśca gururgarīyān |\nna tvatsamo’styabhyadhikaḥ kuto’nyo |\nlokatraye’pyapratimaprabhāva ||","read":"pitaasi lokasya charaacharasya |\ntvamasya poojyashcha gururgareeyaan |\nna tvatsamo'styabhyadhikah kuto'nyo |\nlokatraye'pyapratimaprabhaava ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Father of worlds, of all that moves and stands, Worthier of reverence than the Guru's self, There is none like to Thee. Who passeth Thee? Pre-eminent Thy power in all the worlds.","en2":"Thou art the Father of the world, moving and unmoving; the object of its worship; greater than the great. None there exists who is equal to Thee in the three worlds; who then can excel Thee, O. Thou of power incomparable?","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":44,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तस्मात्प्रणम्य प्रणिधाय कायं ।\nप्रसादये त्वामहमीशमीड्यम् ।\nपितेव पुत्रस्य सखेव सख्युः ।\nप्रियः प्रियायार्हसि देव सोढुम् ॥","iast":"tasmātpraṇamya praṇidhāya kāyaṃ |\nprasādaye tvāmahamīśamīḍyam |\npiteva putrasya sakheva sakhyuḥ |\npriyaḥ priyāyārhasi deva soḍhum ||","read":"tasmaatpranamya pranidhaaya kaayam |\nprasaadaye tvaamahameeshameedyam |\npiteva putrasya sakheva sakhyuh |\npriyah priyaayaarhasi deva sodhum ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Therefore I fall before Thee; with my body I worship as it fitting; bless Thou me. As father with the son, as friend with friend, With the beloved as lover, bear with me.","en2":"So prostrating my body in adoration, I crave Thy forgiveness, Lord adorable! As a father forgiveth his son, friend a dear friend, a beloved one his love, even so shouldst Thou forgive me, O Deva.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":45,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अदृष्टपूर्वं हृषितोऽस्मि दृष्ट्वा ।\nभयेन च प्रव्यथितं मनो मे ।\nतदेव मे दर्शय देव रूपं ।\nप्रसीद देवेश जगन्निवास ॥","iast":"adṛṣṭapūrvaṃ hṛṣito’smi dṛṣṭvā |\nbhayena ca pravyathitaṃ mano me |\ntadeva me darśaya deva rūpaṃ |\nprasīda deveśa jagannivāsa ||","read":"adrishtapoorvam hrishito'smi drishtvaa |\nbhayena cha pravyathitam mano me |\ntadeva me darshaya deva roopam |\npraseeda devesha jagannivaasa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"I have seen that which none hath seen before, My heart is glad, yet faileth me for fear; Show me, O God, Thine other Form again— Mercy, O God of Gods, home of all worlds—","en2":"Overjoyed am I to have seen what I saw never before; yet my mind is distracted with terror. Show me, O Deva, only that Form of Thine. Have mercy, O Lord of Devas, O Abode of the universe.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":46,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"किरीटिनं गदिनं चक्रहस्त ।\nमिच्छामि त्वां द्रष्टुमहं तथैव ।\nतेनैव रूपेण चतुर्भुजेन ।\nसहस्रबाहो भव विश्वमूर्ते ॥","iast":"kirīṭinaṃ gadinaṃ cakrahasta |\nmicchāmi tvāṃ draṣṭumahaṃ tathaiva |\ntenaiva rūpeṇa caturbhujena |\nsahasrabāho bhava viśvamūrte ||","read":"kireetinam gadinam chakrahasta |\nmichchhaami tvaam drashtumaham tathaiva |\ntenaiva roopena chaturbhujena |\nsahasrabaaho bhava vishvamoorte ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Diademed, mace and discus in Thy hand. Again I fain would see Thee as before; Put on again Thy four-armed shape, O Lord, O thousand-armed, of forms innumerate.","en2":"Diademed, bearing a mace and a discus, Thee I desire to see as before. Assume that same four-armed Form, O Thou of thousand arms, of universal Form.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":47,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"मया प्रसन्नेन तवार्जुनेदं ।\nरूपं परं दर्शितमात्मयोगात् ।\nतेजोमयं विश्वमनन्तमाद्यं ।\nयन्मे त्वदन्येन न दृष्टपूर्वम् ॥","iast":"mayā prasannena tavārjunedaṃ |\nrūpaṃ paraṃ darśitamātmayogāt |\ntejomayaṃ viśvamanantamādyaṃ |\nyanme tvadanyena na dṛṣṭapūrvam ||","read":"mayaa prasannena tavaarjunedam |\nroopam param darshitamaatmayogaat |\ntejomayam vishvamanantamaadyam |\nyanme tvadanyena na drishtapoorvam ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: Arjuna, by My favour thou hast seen, This loftiest Form by yoga's self revealed! Radiant, all-penetrating, endless, first, That none except thyself hath ever seen.","en2":"Graciously have I shown to thee, O Arjuna, this Form supreme, by My own Yoga power, this resplendent, primeval, infinite, universal Form of Mine, which hath not been seen before by anyone else.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":48,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"न वेदयज्ञाध्ययनैर्न दानै ।\nर्न च क्रियाभिर्न तपोभिरुग्रैः ।\nएवंरूपः शक्य अहं नृलोके ।\nद्रष्टुं त्वदन्येन कुरुप्रवीर ॥","iast":"na vedayajñādhyayanairna dānai |\nrna ca kriyābhirna tapobhirugraiḥ |\nevaṃrūpaḥ śakya ahaṃ nṛloke |\ndraṣṭuṃ tvadanyena kurupravīra ||","read":"na vedayajnaadhyayanairna daanai |\nrna cha kriyaabhirna tapobhirugraih |\nevamroopah shakya aham nriloke |\ndrashtum tvadanyena kurupraveera ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Nor sacrifice, nor Vedas, alms, nor works, Nor sharp austerity, nor study deep, Can win the vision of this Form for man, Foremost of Kurus, thou alone hast seen.","en2":"Neither by the study of the Veda and Yajna, nor by gifts, nor by rituals, nor by severe austerities, am I in such Form seen, in the world of men, by any other than thee, O great hero of the Kurus.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":49,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मा ते व्यथा मा च विमूढभावो ।\nदृष्ट्वा रूपं घोरमीदृङ्ममेदम् ।\nव्यपेतभीः प्रीतमनाः पुनस्त्वं ।\nतदेव मे रूपमिदं प्रपश्य ॥","iast":"mā te vyathā mā ca vimūḍhabhāvo |\ndṛṣṭvā rūpaṃ ghoramīdṛṅmamedam |\nvyapetabhīḥ prītamanāḥ punastvaṃ |\ntadeva me rūpamidaṃ prapaśya ||","read":"maa te vyathaa maa cha vimoodhabhaavo |\ndrishtvaa roopam ghorameedrinmamedam |\nvyapetabheeh preetamanaah punastvam |\ntadeva me roopamidam prapashya ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Be not bewildered, be thou not afraid, Because thou hast beheld this awful Form; Cast fear away, and let thy heart rejoice; Behold again Mine own familiar shape.","en2":"Be not afraid nor bewildered, having beheld this Form of Mine, so terrific. With thy fears dispelled and with gladdened heart, now see again this (former) form of Mine.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":50,"sp":"sanjaya","spm":null,"spl":"सञ्जय उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"इत्यर्जुनं वासुदेवस्तथोक्त्वा ।\nस्वकं रूपं दर्शयामास भूयः ।\nआश्वासयामास च भीतमेनं ।\nभूत्वा पुनः सौम्यवपुर्महात्मा ॥","iast":"ityarjunaṃ vāsudevastathoktvā |\nsvakaṃ rūpaṃ darśayāmāsa bhūyaḥ |\nāśvāsayāmāsa ca bhītamenaṃ |\nbhūtvā punaḥ saumyavapurmahātmā ||","read":"ityarjunam vaasudevastathoktvaa |\nsvakam roopam darshayaamaasa bhooyah |\naashvaasayaamaasa cha bheetamenam |\nbhootvaa punah saumyavapurmahaatmaa ||","spli":"sañjaya uvāca","splr":"sanjaya uvaacha","en":"Sanjaya said: Vâsudeva, having thus spoken to Arjuna, again manifested His own Form, and consoled the terrified one, the Mahâtman again assuming a gentle form.","en2":"So Vâsudeva, having thus spoken to Arjuna, showed again His own Form and the Great-souled One, assuming His gentle Form, pacified him who was terrified.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":51,"sp":"arjuna","spm":null,"spl":"अर्जुन उवाच","spp":"before","sa":"दृष्ट्वेदं मानुषं रूपं तवसौम्यं जनार्दन ।\nइदानीमस्मि संवृत्तः सचेताः प्रकृतिं गतः ॥","iast":"dṛṣṭvedaṃ mānuṣaṃ rūpaṃ tavasaumyaṃ janārdana |\nidānīmasmi saṃvṛttaḥ sacetāḥ prakṛtiṃ gataḥ ||","read":"drishtvedam maanusham roopam tavasaumyam janaardana |\nidaaneemasmi samvrittah sachetaah prakritim gatah ||","spli":"arjuna uvāca","splr":"arjuna uvaacha","en":"Arjuna said: Beholding again Thy gentle human Form, O Janârdana, I am now collected, and am restored to my own nature.","en2":"Having seen this Thy gentle human Form, O Janârdana, my thoughts are now composed and I am restored to my nature.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":52,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"सुदुर्दर्शमिदं रूपं दृष्टवानसि यन्मम ।\nदेवा अप्यस्य रूपस्य नित्यं दर्शनकाङ्क्षिणः ॥","iast":"sudurdarśamidaṃ rūpaṃ dṛṣṭavānasi yanmama |\ndevā apyasya rūpasya nityaṃ darśanakāṅkṣiṇaḥ ||","read":"sudurdarshamidam roopam drishtavaanasi yanmama |\ndevaa apyasya roopasya nityam darshanakaankshinah ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: This Form of Mine beholden by thee is very hard to see. Verily the Shining Ones ever long to behold this form.","en2":"Very hard indeed it is to see this Form of Mine which thou hast seen. Even the Devas ever long to behold this Form.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":53,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"नाहं वेदैर्न तपसा न दानेन न चेज्यया ।\nशक्य एवंविधो द्रष्टुं दृष्टवानसि मां यथा ॥","iast":"nāhaṃ vedairna tapasā na dānena na cejyayā |\nśakya evaṃvidho draṣṭuṃ dṛṣṭavānasi māṃ yathā ||","read":"naaham vedairna tapasaa na daanena na chejyayaa |\nshakya evamvidho drashtum drishtavaanasi maam yathaa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Nor can I be seen as thou hast seen Me by the Vedas, nor by austerities, nor by alms, or by offerings;","en2":"Neither by the Vedas, nor by austerity, nor by gifts, nor by sacrifice can I be seen as thou hast seen Me.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":54,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"भक्त्या त्वनन्यया शक्य अहमेवंविधोऽर्जुन ।\nज्ञातुं द्रष्टुं च तत्त्वेन प्रवेष्टुं च परन्तप ॥","iast":"bhaktyā tvananyayā śakya ahamevaṃvidho’rjuna |\njñātuṃ draṣṭuṃ ca tattvena praveṣṭuṃ ca parantapa ||","read":"bhaktyaa tvananyayaa shakya ahamevamvidho'rjuna |\njnaatum drashtum cha tattvena praveshtum cha parantapa ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"But by devotion to Me alone I may thus be perceived, Arjuna, and known and seen in essence, and entered, O Parantapa.","en2":"But by the single-minded devotion I may in this Form, be known, O Arjuna, and seen in reality, and also entered into, O scorcher of foes.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":55,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"मत्कर्मकृन्मत्परमो मद्भक्तः सङ्गवर्जितः ।\nनिर्वैरः सर्वभूतेषु यः स मामेति पाण्डव ॥","iast":"matkarmakṛnmatparamo madbhaktaḥ saṅgavarjitaḥ |\nnirvairaḥ sarvabhūteṣu yaḥ sa māmeti pāṇḍava ||","read":"matkarmakrinmatparamo madbhaktah sangavarjitah |\nnirvairah sarvabhooteshu yah sa maameti paandava ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"He who doeth actions for Me, whose supreme good I am, My devotee, freed from attachment without hatred of any being, he cometh unto Me, O Pândava.","en2":"He who does work for Me alone and has Me for his goal, is devoted to Me, is freed from attachment, and bears enmity towards no creature—he entereth into Me, O Pândava.","en2r":null,"rv":null}];
